<title>UK: Shaftesbury sets 63 mln stg debenture. [CORRECTED 10:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Shaftesbury sets 63 mln stg debenture. [CORRECTED 10:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following mortgage debenture stock was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SHAFTESBURY PLC</p>
<p> AMT   *63 MLN STG    COUPON     8.50	MATURITY    31.MAR.24</p>
<p> TYPE   DEBENTURE     ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+90 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	     *FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING SUCH STOCK TO FORM SINGLE</p>
<p>	     ISSUE OF 92 MLN STG</p>
<p> DENOMS     1	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p>(Lead Manager corrects maturity date from 30.SEP.24)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
